Export ladder, superseded by Dk.OpamLock@1.1.11 which derives the GenerateDriver
arguments from a single `pkg=MODULE@VERSION`.

Retired on 2026-08-25 (superseded at HEAD): Dk.OpamBuild@1.0.18 and
Dk.OpamLock@1.1.11, superseded by Dk.OpamBuild@1.0.25 (which adds the
F_BuildLockedClosure whole-closure build rule with hash-named source origins
and the native merge-object prefix merge) and Dk.OpamLock@1.1.12 (which
adds the one-line closure driver shape and shape-aware Refresh). The
OpamBuild Export marker value-id is unchanged (Export@1.0.0 form is
