Retired on 2026-08-27 (superseded at HEAD): Dk.OpamLock@1.1.12, superseded by
Dk.OpamLock@1.1.13 and Apparatus.OpamLockHelper@1.0.16 (the hermetic solve
universe, the with-test re-adoption solve, and reuse_lock=t; see
"## Dk.OpamLock"). The OpamLock Export ladder is re-harvested for @1.1.13.
(Dk.OpamBuild@1.0.19 was a same-version interim that could not ship its fix
past the pre-2.4.2.336 stale-scriptmodule seal; @1.0.20 through @1.0.24
carried successive repairs and are superseded by @1.0.25. See
"## Dk.OpamBuild".)

